{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lv2nVyaNrr1795103387.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大嶼山大東山爛頭營3號石屋，由信和置業家族旗下基金等，以288萬元投得，將用作遠足休憩區。</p><p></p><p>較開價貴約6倍，由黃廷方慈善基金及大澳文物酒店投得，將改建為休憩區，給遠足者及遊客使用，並提供自動販賣機、售賣港式涼茶及朱古力熱飲等。</p><p></p><p>石屋群位於大東山，共22間，當初用作華南基督教傳教士的避暑營地，至今有近百年歷史。</p><p></p><p>今次拍賣的3號石屋，建築面積約2,500平方呎，屬群內面積最小，沒水電供應，而上一手業主，是香港電影導演翁維銓。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:01:01.669637+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:17:16.341017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:14.881657+00:00","content_hash":"161264af2a48195a4dfaf0675bc2bed0b12d4a9a8dccc36c263d5cd4ded0a759","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:01:01.669637+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}